+| `CHROMERS_SAVE_ROOTS` | `web=~/Archive/web` | Folders `save.*` may write into, by name: `web=~/Archive/web,docs=/srv/docs` |
 | `CHROMIUM_BIN` | snap Chromium | For `launch-chromium.sh`, e.g. your own build |
 
